WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:01.967
Everything on this site,

00:00:01.833 --> 00:00:03.900
1,914 things, read into 3,499

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:04.500
passages.

00:00:04.633 --> 00:00:06.900
52 books, 79 essays, 26

00:00:06.767 --> 00:00:09.000
races, 1,677 short posts.

00:00:09.133 --> 00:00:13.000
Ask anything. In English, or

00:00:12.867 --> 00:00:14.500
in Marathi.

00:00:14.633 --> 00:00:18.400
What has running taught him?

00:00:18.267 --> 00:00:22.000
It looks first, then answers,

00:00:21.867 --> 00:00:25.300
and shows every page the

00:00:25.167 --> 00:00:27.500
answer came from.

00:00:27.633 --> 00:00:29.700
If one model is busy, the

00:00:29.567 --> 00:00:31.867
next one answers. If they all

00:00:31.733 --> 00:00:33.500
are, it still searches.

00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:35.667
The same archive in two

00:00:35.533 --> 00:00:37.400
shells: classic, or the

00:00:37.267 --> 00:00:39.633
atlas. And it follows you on

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:40.500
every page.

00:00:40.633 --> 00:00:44.133
Ask it anything. It shows its

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.000
sources.
